   "function": "insight",
   "scene_type": "sc_step",
   "spoken": "The setting that was missing: two-step verification. The NCSC recommends it for your email account, plus a separate password used nowhere else. Germany's BSI says: switch on two-factor login wherever a service offers it, especially for email.",
